# Copy to .cursor/yandex-smtp.env (gitignored) and fill in real values there.
# Yandex → ID → Безопасность → Пароли приложений → создать пароль для «Почта».
# From address must be this mailbox or an alias on it.
#
# Required in .cursor/yandex-smtp.env (do not put secrets in this example):
#   YANDEX_SMTP_USER=<mailbox@your-domain>
#   YANDEX_SMTP_PASS=<yandex-app-password>
# Optional:
#   YANDEX_SMTP_FROM_NAME=PromptShot
#   YANDEX_SMTP_HOST=smtp.yandex.ru
#   YANDEX_SMTP_PORT=465
